  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  speakerName: The driver
  lines:
  - She just walked off the kerb. Never stop, never look left, never look right.
    Just walked out like that.
  - I had half a second only. Half a second, how to stop a car? You tell me.
  - Six years I drive that road, never even scratch. Go and see from where I was
    sitting, then you tell me what I should have done.
  offerPovReplay: 1
  povButtonLabel: See what he saw
  subject: {fileID: 0}
