  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  speakerName: The pedestrian
  lines:
  - I've crossed there like a hundred times already. That road is damn quiet at that
    hour, who would expect a car coming so fast?
  - I didn't hear anything leh. No engine, no horn, nothing. One second I'm on the
    kerb, next thing I'm on the ground.
  - And his headlights weren't even on. Confirm. If he had lights I would have seen
    him from way up the road.
  offerPovReplay: 1
  povButtonLabel: See what she saw
  subject: {fileID: 0}
